# Governed CVE waiver list for the InnBucks cell image scan.
#
# RULES (a waiver without all three is a review failure):
#   * every entry carries: the CVE id, an owner, a one-line reason, and a
#     review-by date — as a comment directly above the id
#   * prefer fixing/upgrading over waiving; a waiver is a scheduled debt,
#     not a dismissal
#   * remove entries at their review date or renew them consciously
#
# The Release workflow scans CRITICAL/HIGH with --ignore-unfixed, so only
# FIXABLE vulnerabilities ever gate the push — a red gate means an upgrade
# exists and should usually just be taken.

# (no waivers yet)
